<title>JAPAN: Ishihara Constr -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ishihara Constr -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.99		vs	   11.28</p>
<p> Operating   loss 139    million	  vs   loss 849    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 277    million	  vs   loss 938    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 281    million	  vs     prft 4.54</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 4.17 yen	  vs   prft 111.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     67 million	  vs	  41 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - Ishihara Construction Co Ltd is a general contractor specialising in condominium construction.</p>
